        {
          "text": "Lino mizumo iili musanu aibili niyakamana kundindima, ndakati lembe, pele ndakaswiilila ijwi lyakazwa kujulu, liti, Namatika zintu ezyo nziyaamba mizumo iili musanu aibili, utazilembi pe. ",
