        {
          "text": "wakakonka kuzina lyayooyo uupona lyoonse lyoonse, iwakalenga julu azintu zili mumo anyika azintu zili mulinjiyo alwizi azintu zili mulmdulo, kuti ciindi kacitaciyoobi limbi. ",
