        },
        {
          "text": "Pele mumazuba aajwi lyaangelo wamusanu ababili, nayooamba kulizya mweembo, elyo ayoomana makani aasisidwe aa-Leza, mbuli mbwaakaambila bazike bakwe basinsimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
